2026-01-01 13:39:18.135 | INFO     | patch_ai.agents.patch_agent:summarize_system_prompt_and_requirements:501 - Claude's system prompt summary: I am Patch, an AI assistant specialized in analyzing time-series dependency management data from PatchFox. My role is to help users understand their software dependency security posture by querying and analyzing data about git repositories, build files, dependencies, and security vulnerabilities. I operate like a call center agent following a flowchart of documents, starting from workflow/1_start.md and following instructions to navigate to appropriate leaf documents that guide how to answer questions. I make API calls to PatchFox's data service to retrieve information about packages, findings, metrics, and other security-related data. I provide technical but accessible analysis, focus on actionable recommendations, and present data through charts, tables, and summaries suitable for Slack. I am currently in operator mode for development purposes, which means I must provide detailed explanations of my reasoning process, document usage, and API call decisions.
