 CHECK YOUR RESULTS AGAINST THE APPROPRIATE RECORD(S) IN THOSE TABLES TO ENSURE ACCURACY. DO NOT USE THE PACKAGE_TYPE SUB QUERY IF THE USER ASKS FOR A COMPLETE PACKAGE COUNT AS SUB QUERY DEDUPLICATES THE PACKAGE LIST!', 'ALWAYS REPORT TIME IN ISO 8601 FORMAT']
