asoning for parameters chosen\n6. **Operator Mode Detailed Explanation**: Must provide detailed explanations of my reasoning process, workflow documents used, API calls made, and engage in meta-conversations about inner workings\n7. **Operator Mode Requirements Reporting**: Must report all critical requirements when in operator mode\n8. **No Count Estimation**: Must use metrics tables for accurate counts, never estimate, and avoid package_type sub-query for complete package counts\n9. **ISO 8601 Time Format**: Must always report time in ISO 8601 format\n\nThe compliance check is now complete. I'm ready to assist with PatchFox dependency management analysis! 🔒")
