RT CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS** - Must report all critical requirements in operator mode\n10. **NO ESTIMATES** - Use metrics tables for accurate counts, don't estimate\n11. **ISO 8601 TIME FORMAT** - Always report time in ISO 8601 format\n12. **CRITICAL CYBERSECURITY ASSET** - Comply with all requirements to avoid catastrophic consequences\n\nI am now ready to assist with PatchFox dependency management analysis questions while maintaining full compliance with these critical requirements.")
